  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/smol-machines/smolvm/zipball/v1.25.2",
  "body": "## What's Changed\n* Add a command that prints shell completion scripts by @0xprames in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1612\n* Install system-wide as root and refuse to serve when per-VM uids cannot reach smolvm by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1616\n* Cache S3 mount lookups and small files, and serve requests concurrently by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1618\n* Copy disk templates without writing their zero runs and resize storage before moving /dev by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1619\n* Let exec refuse to boot a stopped machine with autoStart false, and keep serve on /workspace inside a smol machine by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1615\n* Bump libkrun so frozen branches of a continued source and branchable clones work correctly and fast by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1622\n* Record a directory entry's owner on Windows, so packed layers extract by @WynandVStaden in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1617\n* Add cache disk slots, so one checkpoint can be restored with a different cache mounted for each machine by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1621\n* Bump version to 1.25.2 by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1623\n* Mount a restored cache slot only into the machine's own containers by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1624\n\n## New Contributors\n* @0xprames made their first contribution in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1612\n* @WynandVStaden made their first contribution in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1617\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/compare/v1.25.1...v1.25.2",
